### Local, empty-database example only. Do not switch these fixed IDs to the shared Render demo.
### For hosted/seeded data, use the Postman collection with automatic ID capture and Render environment.
### Use VS Code REST Client or translate requests to curl. IDs assume an empty database.
@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### Create Mohit
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Mohit"}

### Create Rahul
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Rahul"}

### Create Ankit
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ankit"}

### Create group
POST {{base}}/groups
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Goa Trip"}

### Add Mohit
PUT {{base}}/groups/1/members/1

### Add Rahul
PUT {{base}}/groups/1/members/2

### Add Ankit
PUT {{base}}/groups/1/members/3

### Record equal expense; split_type defaults to equal
POST {{base}}/groups/1/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{"paid_by":1,"amount":"1200.00","description":"Dinner"}

### Direct balances
GET {{base}}/groups/1/balances

### Minimum-payment plan for a small group
GET {{base}}/groups/1/settlement-suggestions

### Personal consumption and cash flow
GET {{base}}/users/1/analytics

### Search entities and features
GET {{base}}/search?q=Goa

### Record an external payment
POST {{base}}/groups/1/settlements
Content-Type: application/json

{"from_user_id":2,"to_user_id":1,"amount":"400.00","mode":"direct","note":"Received via UPI"}

### Record Ankit's payment
POST {{base}}/groups/1/settlements
Content-Type: application/json

{"from_user_id":3,"to_user_id":1,"amount":"400.00","mode":"direct","note":"Received via UPI"}

### Verify all balances cleared
GET {{base}}/groups/1/balances

### Unequal split bonus
POST {{base}}/groups/1/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{"paid_by":1,"amount":"1000.00","description":"Activities","split_type":"custom","splits":[{"user_id":1,"amount":"500.00"},{"user_id":2,"amount":"300.00"},{"user_id":3,"amount":"200.00"}]}

### Paginated personal consumption
GET {{base}}/users/1/analytics/expenses?limit=1&offset=0&sort=amount_desc
